{"ref":"BDB, שׁוֹבָל","hw":"שׁוֹבָל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹבָל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  Edomite name <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:20\" href=\"/Genesis.36.20\">Gn 36:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:23\" href=\"/Genesis.36.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:29\" href=\"/Genesis.36.29\">29</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1 Ch 1:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.40\">40</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  in Caleb <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:50\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.50\">1 Ch 2:50</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:52\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.52\">52</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.1\">1 Ch 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.2\">2</a>.—Σαβα(λ), Σουβαλ.","next":"BDB, שַׁבְּלוּל²","prev":"BDB, שְׁבוּל"}